  "question": {
    "text": "The tangent at any point on the curve <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> makes intercepts on the coordinate axes as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>.</mo></math> Then the value of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
